---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import release from '../lib/release.json';
import build from '../lib/build.json';
---
<Base title="Verified release evidence" description="Actual source identities, deployed outcomes and remaining App Composer acceptance gates. Preparation and production are distinct."><h1>Show the working result.</h1><p class="lede">{release.state}</p><p>Reviewed {release.reviewed}. Composer source <code>{build.commit}</code>.</p><section class="section"><h2>Source and ownership</h2>{release.sources.map((s:any)=><p><a href={s.url}>{s.name}</a><br/><code>{s.commit}</code></p>)}</section><section class="section"><h2>Verified outcomes</h2><ul>{release.verified.map(v=><li>{v}</li>)}</ul></section><section class="section"><h2>Open gates</h2><ul>{release.remaining.map(v=><li>{v}</li>)}</ul><p>The canonical issue evidence is maintained in <a href="https://github.com/loftwah/app-composer/issues/11">GitHub #11</a>. Current Worker identity is returned at <a href="/build.json">build.json</a>. Tests do not prove a physical device, commercial demand or a public multi-tenant security certification.</p></section></Base>
